       "id": "26497963"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Component of the CAVIN complex composed of CAVIN1, CAVIN2, CAVIN3 and CAVIN4 (By similarity). Interacts with CAVIN1, ADRA1A and ADRA1B (PubMed:24567387). Interacts with CAVIN2; this augments the transactivation of NPPA (PubMed:18332105, PubMed:24567387). Interacts with CAV3 (PubMed:24567387, PubMed:26497963). Interacts with MAPK1 and MAPK3 (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
